  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth entrepreneurial ecosystem mapping and analysis, Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will execute a thorough mapping and analysis of the current entrepreneurial ecosystem in Zimbabwe focusing on Harare, Bulawayo and Mutare. By extensive desk research and by engaging directly with local incubation programmes, knowledge institutions, government organisations, entrepreneurial champions, aspiring students and all other relevant stakeholders, an assessment of the current ecosystem will be delivered. Opportunities for collaboration with partners and/or for additional ecosystem strengthening activities in future projects will be provided as well.</narrative>
  </description>
